# SPACBR — X11 / window-manager layer
#
# The graphical session itself: Xorg, the libraries the Suckless
# components are built against, and the session infrastructure that
# owns one responsibility each (compositor, notifications, idle-lock).
# One package per line; installed via: pacman -S --needed - < packages/x11

xorg-server
xorg-xinit
xorg-xrandr
xorg-xrdb
xorg-xmodmap
xorg-xset
xorg-xsetroot
xorg-xinput
libx11
libxft
libxinerama
dbus
picom
dunst
hsetroot
xss-lock
# imlib2 was already a transitive dependency of hsetroot; slock now
# needs its headers directly too, to build its blurred-lock-screen
# background (see .local/src/slock/slock.c and config.h's BLUR option).
imlib2
